From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:15:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc-apple: select certified AOP reload through
 DT

A retained AOP must not be reset as though it were a fresh boot.
Describe the retained-reload properties: the certified-reload flag, the
reserved shutdown page and the power domains the reload observes.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
---
 .../bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8010-aop.yaml    | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8010-aop.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8010-aop.yaml
index 32788d1c7..74586c6e0 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8010-aop.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8010-aop.yaml
@@ -18,6 +18,10 @@ description:
   board-specific and is loaded by the operating system.
 
 properties:
+  apple,certified-reload:
+    type: boolean
+    description: Firmware supports the retained shutdown certificate for warm reload.
+
   compatible:
     enum:
       - apple,s8000-aop
@@ -70,6 +74,20 @@ properties:
       The SoC's chip revision, filled in by the bootloader. The S8000
       firmware's boot arguments carry it.
 
+  memory-region:
+    maxItems: 1
+    description: Reserved 16 KiB shutdown transcript page for J71t warm reload.
+
+  apple,observe-domains:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle-array
+    minItems: 5
+    maxItems: 5
+    description: AOP GPIO, AOP, bus interface, CPU and filter in lock order.
+
+  apple,spi0-domain:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
+    description: Read-only SPI0 power-state provider observation.
+
 patternProperties:
   "^(accel|gyro|compass|pressure)$":
     type: object
